:"","priority":5,"questId":20512,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":205120101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":1912190586,"text":"This prescription's just getting weirder...","nextNodeIds":[205120102]},{"nodeId":205120102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2247039114,"text":"How's Anna doing?","nextNodeIds":[205120103]},{"nodeId":205120103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":4173772850,"text":"Oh, it's you. Well, it might sound hard to believe, but Anna says that she's been feeling much better.","nextNodeIds":[205120104]},{"nodeId":205120104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2910279066,"text":"Perhaps that doctor's prescription is really working? I can scarcely believe it myself.","nextNodeIds":[205120105]},{"nodeId":205120105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3804900282,"text":"Well, regardless of whether it's true or not, it's best to keep going.","nextNodeIds":[205120106]},{"nodeId":205120106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":1229554458,"text":"The prescription this time is... Hmm. Could you help me find \"Thick Condensate of a Hydro Slime\"?","nextNodeIds":[205120107,205120112,205120117]},{"nodeId":205120107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3650312434,"text":"This one sounds normal enough.","nextNodeIds":[205120108]},{"nodeId":205120108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":1150671394,"text":"Um, really? I actually think the opposite is true.","nextNodeIds":[205120109]},{"nodeId":205120109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2035481354,"text":"But at least it's easy to find. I've asked around, and they say that you can get Thick Condensate just by defeating Large Slimes.","nextNodeIds":[205120110]},{"nodeId":205120110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":728482370,"text":"I've heard Jack say that you can lure Large Slimes out by constantly defeating smaller ones.","nextNodeIds":[205120111]},{"nodeId":205120111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":964757466,"text":"I don't have that kind of combat skill, so I'm counting on you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205120112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2757275826,"text":"Don't worry, this one might be edible.","nextNodeIds":[205120113]},{"nodeId":205120113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":4198433082,"text":"And how do you know that? Have you tried it before? ...Um, why aren't you saying anything?","nextNodeIds":[205120114]},{"nodeId":205120114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":1410956378,"text":"Whatever. Hydro Slimes should be quite easy to find. I've asked around, and others have said that you can get Thick Condensate by defeating Large Slimes.","nextNodeIds":[205120115]},{"nodeId":205120115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3799294002,"text":"I've heard Jack say that you can lure Large Slimes out by constantly defeating smaller ones.","nextNodeIds":[205120116]},{"nodeId":205120116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2924787386,"text":"I don't have that kind of combat skill, so I'm counting on you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205120117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":149255354,"text":"I know where to get some.","nextNodeIds":[205120118]},{"nodeId":205120118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2284295858,"text":"Well, that's good. Looks like you're well-versed in dealing with Slimes.","nextNodeIds":[205120119]},{"nodeId":205120119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2109822578,"text":"Thanks for agreeing to help. You should be able to get some Thick Condensate just by defeating Large Slimes.","nextNodeIds":[205120120]},{"nodeId":205120120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3602143970,"text":"I've heard Jack say that you can lure Large Slimes out by constantly defeating smaller ones.","nextNodeIds":[205120121]},{"nodeId":205120121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3642067514,"text":"Well then, best of luck to you.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2051201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1408"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2051202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Acquire some Thick Hydro Slime Condensate","stepDescTextMapHash":3577720836,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[100455,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_OBTAIN_ITEM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q20512_Water